2026-07-27T08:12:55.8527623Z i /tmp/RtmptZN6bK/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8528117Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8528723Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8529552Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8530393Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8531609Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:12:55.8532481Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
